.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
hardware/*/*-backups/
hardware/*/*.kicad_prl

# Third-party documents (manufacturer datasheets, reference-design files, competitor datasheets, the ST firmware
# package) are NOT redistributed in this repository. docs/SOURCES.csv lists every file with its URL and SHA-256;
# `python docs/fetch.py` downloads them again. Our own notes (README.md, spec.md, FIRMWARE-NOTES.md) and the
# manifests stay in the repository.
docs/datasheets/*/*
docs/reference-designs/**
!docs/reference-designs/**/
!docs/reference-designs/**/*.md
!docs/reference-designs/**/*.csv
